BEGIN_DESC
MPU / EMPU. The KSC runway: a charging station, the electric platform EMPU (driver already at the wheel) 12 m from it, an open MPU 12 m behind. Both start half empty.
Menu: look at a thing within reach - its actions show beside the aim; mouse wheel picks, F does. Alt = cursor.
Drive: W/S, A/D, Shift+W full power, Space brake, B parking brake, Caps Lock platform up/down. EMPU terminal: click the screen or the keys at its sides (SETUP: language, speed limiter).
Charge: F at the station's reel - take the cable; F at the machine's socket (front bumper, right) - plug in. Cells: F at a bay or at the station's rack.
Couple: stand 2-4 m from the other machine, F at the coupling.
END_DESC

